sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant BFF as BFF<br/>QR validation
  participant Order as Order<br/>session owner
  participant Catalog as Catalog<br/>table owner
  participant ODB as PostgreSQL<br/>Order DB

  BFF->>BFF: Validate QR signature<br/>extract tenantId + tableId
  BFF->>Order: Join or create session
  Order->>Catalog: Validate table ownership<br/>via TCP contract
  Catalog-->>Order: Table belongs to tenant<br/>current status AVAILABLE

  Order->>ODB: Check active session<br/>by tenant + table
  alt No active session found
    Order->>ODB: Create ACTIVE session row
    Order->>Catalog: Update table to OCCUPIED
    Catalog-->>Order: Table updated
    Order-->>BFF: New session created
  else Active session exists
    Order-->>BFF: Return existing session
  end

  Note over Order,Catalog: Session creation requires: valid QR, table belongs to tenant, no duplicate active session for that table.
